eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-4852.txt","https://github.com/roo7break/serialator","https://github.com/zhzhdoai/Weblogic_Vuln","https://github.com/minhangxiaohui/Weblogic_direct_T3_Rces","https://github.com/AndersonSingh/serialization-vulnerability-scanner","https://github.com/nex1less/CVE-2015-4852"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0509.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0520","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4902","title":"Oracle Java SE Deployment 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 6u101、7u85 和 8u60 版本中存在的未指定漏洞，允许远程攻击者通过与部署相关的未知向量影响系统完整性。该漏洞属于拒绝服务类型，无需身份认证即可触发，攻击者可构造特制的部署包或利用 Java Web Start 组件中的缺陷，使目标系统出现服务中断或数据损坏。Oracle 已在后续安全更新中修复此问题，建议用户升级至不受影响的版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4902"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-10-22T00:00:03.093","updated":"2026-06-17T00:28:08.793","remediation":"升级 Oracle Java SE 至 6u102、7u91 或 8u66 及以上版本，禁用 Java Deployment Toolkit 及 Java Plug-in 组件，通过系统部署策略阻止未签名 Java Applet 的自动执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-11/msg00009.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00000.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-12/msg00014.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-01/msg00005.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-01/msg00045.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1926.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1927.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1928.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2506.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2507.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2508.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2509.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2518.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuoct2015-2367953.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/77241","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033884","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016:1430","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201603-11","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-4902","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-4902.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0ff539514ffae70ea73031a227022cb4e6068a50/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4902.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4902","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/89f31769b238b7aadc0135ad71a93cfb675d75e7/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4902.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-4902.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/db7b79d6c7c784d1fe9dff4a2c837eeb2235c805/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-4902.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2015-4902","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2015/CVE-2015-4902.md","https://github.com/frknaykc/Dragon-ThreatResearchHQ/blob/60fee7342ce45714e093570c2b43b364e1deecb8/feeds/cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0686","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-7645","title":"Adobe Flash Player 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 的 AVM 序列化器（AvmSerializer.cpp）在处理实现 IExternalizable 接口的类时存在类型混淆漏洞。当 IExternalizable.writeExternal 方法被非函数值覆盖时，Flash Player 仍将其当作函数调用，导致方法在 ActionScript vtable 之外执行，引发内存损坏，最终可实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Adobe Flash Player 18.x 至 18.0.0.252、19.x 至 19.0.0.207（Windows 和 macOS）以及 11.x 至 11.2.202.535（Linux）版本。攻击条件为受害者打开含恶意 SWF 文件的网页，无需身份认证，攻击者可通过恶意网页、电子邮件或社工手段诱使目标在浏览器或 Flash Player 中加载特制 SWF 文件即可触发。该漏洞于 2015 年 10 月已被在野利用，攻击者构造特制的 SWF 文件，利用 writeExternal 的类型混淆机制覆盖方法为变量，从而触发内存损坏并执行任意代码。Adobe 已在安全公告 APSB15-27 中发布更新版本修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版 Flash Player。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-7645"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-10-15T10:59:10.530","updated":"2026-06-17T00:32:53.400","remediation":"建议立即卸载 Adobe Flash Player（Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持），从控制面板或使用官方卸载工具彻底移除，以根除攻击面。如业务必须使用，请升级至安全公告 APSB15-27 中的修复版本（Flash Player 19.0.0.245 或更高），并在所有浏览器中将 Flash 插件设为\"点击运行\"或彻底禁用，同时限制用户访问不可信网站及打开可疑 SWF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/new-adobe-flash-zero-day-used-in-pawn-storm-campaign/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-10/msg00015.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-10/msg00016.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-10/msg00017.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-10/msg00018.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134009/Adobe-Flash-IExternalizable.writeExternal-Type-Confusion.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1913.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-2024.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/77081","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033850","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsa15-05.html","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-27.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201511-02","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38490/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-7645","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38490","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2015/CVE-2015-7645.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2ec755a8842ea85cee0159a0fa44132731ba801f/2015/7xxx/CVE-2015-7645.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-7645","https://github.com/irsdl/top10webseclist/blob/6f669896be0e6634f335cdeb80bf91c986e0e552/2015.md","https://github.com/thdusdl1219/CVE-Study/blob/6bc0a2f8bf5ddd6089bc9ce22188a24c1d44d24e/CVEs/CVE-2015-7645/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-7645.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73a8b58807bbd8e2a24b27e9365e9527f4708b8f/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-7645.json","https://github.com/Ebiquity/CASIE/blob/2c8beef56d48e8de6599891c6a5e0e5f0d82e20c/data/source/120.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2015-7645","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/115073.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0406","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2546","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核模式驱动程序 内存损坏权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 内核模式驱动程序 (win32k.sys) 存在内存损坏漏洞，本地攻击者可通过精心构造的应用程序触发内核内存损坏，从而提升权限至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞源于 Win32k 内核驱动程序在处理特定图形对象或窗口消息时未正确验证用户模式传入的指针或大小参数，导致内核内存越界读写。影响范围覆盖 Windows Vista SP2 至 Windows 10 初版及对应 Server 版本（含 Server 2008/2012/R2），CVSS 3.1 评分 8.2 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地、低攻击复杂度、低权限、需用户交互、权限范围改变、机密性/完整性/可用性均高影响。攻击者需诱导用户运行恶意程序，通过精心构造的 GDI 对象或窗口消息触发内核池溢出或 Use-After-Free，实现任意内核代码执行提权。Microsoft 已于 2015 年 9 月补丁周二发布补丁修复（MS15-097），CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），GitHub 上已有多个公开 PoC/EXP 代码（含补丁对比分析与 x86 利用代码）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2546"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-09-09T00:59:53.207","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:16.817","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2015 年 10 月安全更新，Windows 7 SP1/8/8.1/10 需更新到 KB3085577 或更高版本，通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用未签名驱动程序加载功能并限制常规用户权限访问 win32k.sys 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/76608","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033485","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-097","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2546","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2546.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/264ef61746a7918b62cf1abbd77516d3c9b09ba8/2015/CVE-2015-2546.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2015-2546/README.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B]CVE-2015-2546%20%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.md","https://github.com/SuperKieran/WooyunDrops/blob/df3319b3cd839f447ba2d1ab191b6a4b57991d0a/static/drops/796.CVE-2015-2546%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E8%A1%A5%E4%B8%81%E6%AF%94%E5%AF%B9%E5%88%B0Exploit.html","https://github.com/jiji262/wooyun_articles/blob/047a8eaf7accf18e889faaa7043c5bb51430ec17/drops/CVE-2015-2546%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E8%A1%A5%E4%B8%81%E6%AF%94%E5%AF%B9%E5%88%B0Exploit.html","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2546","https://github.com/leeqwind/HolicPOC/blob/58705c366b5acfe366cab5ad535a710775ba9897/windows/win32k/CVE-2015-2546/x86.cpp","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2546.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2546.txt","https://github.com/k0keoyo/CVE-2015-2546-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0400","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2545","title":"微软 Office EPS 文件漏洞畸形","description":"微软 Office 2007 SP3、2010 SP2、2013 SP1 和 2013 RT SP1 等版本在处理 EPS 文件时存在解析漏洞。攻击者可通过精心构造的畸形 EPS 文件，利用 Office 组件的弱点触发内存 corruption 并执行任意代码。该漏洞属于本地权限提升类型，攻击者无需权限即可触发，但需要用户交互（如打开恶意 EPS 文件）。受影响版本涵盖了多个 Microsoft Office 产品，攻击者可借此获取系统控制权。漏洞成因源于 EPS 文件解析过程中对输入数据的安全验证不足，导致代码执行控制权被恶意文件接管。此类漏洞的利用通常通过构建包含恶意 shellcode 的 EPS 文件，借助 Office 组件的自动加载机制达到远程代码执行的效果。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2545"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-09-09T00:59:52.190","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:16.650","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2015 年 9 月安全更新 MS15-099 (KB3085502、KB3085503、KB3085516、KB3085565)，分别对应 Office 2007 SP3、2010 SP2、2013 SP1、2013 RT SP1 修补版本。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装对应 KB 补丁包。无法立即打补丁时，可在组策略中禁用 EPS 文件格式解析（User Configuration > Administrative Templates > Microsoft Office 2010/2013 > Word Options > Advanced > Disable EPS picture format），或在信任中心禁用 EPS 文件打开预览，并部署 EMET 5.5 启用 EAF/SEHOP 缓解措施作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.morphisec.com/exploit-bypass-emet-cve-2015-2545","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033488","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-099","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2545","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2545.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2015-2545.yar","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2545.json","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2015-2545/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2545","https://github.com/sansan777/MalKG/blob/4c74a30e04594e71325b3d92ba0115fde5e7af86/Code/NER/Threat%20Reports/2016/exploring-cve-2015-2545-and-its-users.html.txt","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/APT37/APT37_hash.md","https://github.com/burakgulbay/apt-scope/blob/bef38cdbcd207e1d83fca8f1d6f7f350ecbc7fd1/apt_reports_extracted_iocs_files/PwC_Exploring_CVE-2015-2545(05-06-2016).pdf.iocs","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2015-2545.json","https://github.com/CyberMonitor/APT_CyberCriminal_Campagin_Collections/blob/cbf136e24f5d2a4d89619580455aae8b9b0aeadb/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0021","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2807","title":"WordPress Navis DocumentCloud 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Navis DocumentCloud 插件 0.1.1 之前版本的 `js/window.php` 文件中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者通过 `wpbase` 参数注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息泄露等危害。攻击条件为诱使用户点击恶意构造的 URL，无需身份认证，影响该插件的所有使用版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2807"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-09-01T14:59:02.073","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:47.393","remediation":"立即将 Navis DocumentCloud 插件升级至 0.1.1 或更高版本。如无法升级，可删除插件目录中 `js/window.php` 文件，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则过滤 `wpbase` 参数中的恶意脚本代码作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133350/WordPress-Navis-DocumentCloud-0.1-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Aug/78","https://security.dxw.com/advisories/publicly-exploitable-xss-in-wordpress-plugin-navis-documentcloud/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/navis-documentcloud/changelog/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8164","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2807.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2807.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2807.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2807/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-2807.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2807_5.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-2807-2499.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2807.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-2807-2497.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-2807-2500.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/26/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/elijah-bennett0/IntentLimit/blob/bcfe225cf61ee454aa53896f7f3120246f52119f/tools/exploitation/CrazyIngrate/exploits/cve_2015_2807/cve_2015_2807.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0333","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2502","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 7 至 11 版本存在内存破坏漏洞（CVE-2015-2502，CWE-787 越界写入），源于 IE 浏览器引擎在处理特制网页内容时对内存对象的错误管理，导致越界写入破坏内存结构。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意网站触发该漏洞，利用用户交互（UI:R）在目标系统上下文中执行任意代码（C:H/I:H/A:H），或导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N）、攻击复杂度低（AC:L）、无需权限（PR:N），2015 年 8 月已在野利用，微软随即发布紧急安全更新（MS15-093）修复。影响范围覆盖 Windows 系统预装的 IE 7/8/9/10/11，用户访问恶意页面即可触发，无需额外权限，危害等级高。微软于 2015 年 8 月发布紧急补丁修复该漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2502"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-08-19T10:59:00.090","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:12.337","remediation":"立即通过 Windows Update 安装 Microsoft 2015 年 8 月安全更新 MS15-093 (KB3087040)，将 IE 7-11 升级至最新版本。无法立即更新时，可暂时禁用 IE 并改用 Chrome/Firefox 替代浏览器，或在防火墙/代理层面拦截可疑网页脚本执行作为临时缓解。若无法升级 IE，建议启用 Enhanced Protected Mode (IE10/11) 并禁用 VBScript 脚本引擎作为缓解措施，同时部署网络层 IPS 规则拦截已知利用载荷特征。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://twitter.com/Laughing_Mantis/statuses/633839231840841728","http://twitter.com/Laughing_Mantis/statuses/633839771865886721","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/76403","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033317","http://www.securityweek.com/microsoft-issues-emergency-patch-critical-ie-flaw-exploited-wild","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-093","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2502","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2502.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2502","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-2502-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2502/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2502.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2502.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-2502.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2015.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/798a31226c5b1d5c9cc61c5fe52f04996d380b21/data_single/2015/CVE-2015-2502.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0198","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1769","title":"Microsoft Windows Mount Manager本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Mount Manager 存在本地权限提升漏洞，根因是 Mount Manager 对符号链接处理不当。攻击者需具备物理接触权限，通过插入精心制作的恶意 USB 设备（包含恶意符号链接），诱导 Mount Manager 错误处理符号链接，从而以提升后的权限在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2、Windows RT/8.1 及 Windows 10 等多个版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.6（中等），攻击向量为物理接触，攻击复杂度低，需低权限且无需用户交互，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。Microsoft 已在 2015 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。攻击者需物理接触目标设备并插入恶意 USB 设备才能利用，属于物理接触型本地提权漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1769"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-08-15T00:59:01.467","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:57.410","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2015/08/11/defending-against-cve-2015-1769-a-logical-issue-exploited-via-a-malicious-usb-stick.aspx","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033244","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-085","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1769","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1769.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/264ef61746a7918b62cf1abbd77516d3c9b09ba8/2015/CVE-2015-1769.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/62d3575ad7f5edb0085d16f3737a19e0c0ea724b/2015/CVE-2015-1769/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-1769","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2515f07573bc23c1f79f0d197a09a6f29d3e20ae/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1769.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-1769-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-1769.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-1769.html","https://github.com/hongson11698/defender-database-extract/blob/b2d3eaf6fde055046de74ffbe286bb635696356d/av_db/lua/_!CVE-2015-1769/Unknowcategory/0x0000007f_script.lua","https://github.com/int0/CVE-2015-1769"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0109","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1642","title":"Microsoft Office/Word Viewer 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 及 Word Viewer 存在内存损坏漏洞（CWE-787），影响 Microsoft Office 2007 SP3、Office 2010 SP2、Office 2013 SP1 及 Word Viewer 等版本。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意内容的特制 Office 文档（如 Word 文档），诱使用户打开该文档来触发漏洞。当程序未能正确处理文档中的畸形数据时，会引发越界写入（Out-of-bounds Write），导致内存损坏。攻击者可利用此漏洞在受影响系统上执行任意代码，获取与当前用户相同的权限。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户主动打开恶意文件（如通过邮件附件、网页下载等方式分发），成功利用后可完全控制受害者系统。Microsoft 已于 2015 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，该漏洞已被 CISA 纳入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1642"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-08-15T00:59:00.110","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:45.180","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS15-081 (KB3080790) 对应的补丁：Office 2007 SP3 安装 KB2687409，Office 2010 SP2 安装 KB2965310，Office 2013 SP1 安装 KB3039734。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。Word Viewer 已停止支持，建议卸载并迁移至 Microsoft 365 或受支持的 Office 版本。若无法立即打补丁，应启用 Office 文件阻止规则禁止打开来源不明的文档，并部署终端防护软件拦截恶意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033239","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-081","https://www.verisign.com/en_US/security-services/security-intelligence/vulnerability-reports/articles/index.xhtml?id=1203","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1642","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1642.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-1642","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2515f07573bc23c1f79f0d197a09a6f29d3e20ae/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1642.json","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-1642.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-1642.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2015/CVE-2015-1642.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f9w6-fcw4-8qmv/GHSA-f9w6-fcw4-8qmv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0040","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4666","title":"Xceedium Xsuite 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Xceedium Xsuite 的 opm/read_sessionlog.php 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 logFile 参数传入 ....//（四点双斜杠）序列绕过路径过滤，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Xceedium Xsuite 2.4.4.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前官方已停止维护，建议用户迁移至替代产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4666"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-08-13T14:59:05.173","updated":"2026-06-17T00:27:41.673","remediation":"立即升级 Xceedium Xsuite 至 2.4.4.6 或更高版本（该版本已于 2015 年 8 月 17 日前发布）。对于已更名为 CA Privileged Access Manager 的产品，建议升级至 3.0.0 或更高版本以修复所有已知漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面配置访问控制规则，限制对 `/opm/read_sessionlog.php` 路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 段访问管理后台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132809/Xceedium-Xsuite-Command-Injection-XSS-Traversal-Escalation.html","http://www.modzero.ch/advisories/MZ-15-02-Xceedium-Xsuite.txt","https://support.ca.com/us/product-content/recommended-reading/security-notices/ca20180614-01--security-notice-for-ca-privileged-access-manager.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37708/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4666.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-4666.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d51e9a38ae587ccdf7a75fe6aa0e11c81e7d7972/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4666.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4666.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-4666-2538.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a49c1ee62b0cdcd9e0017ab19afbdf5bcbf6833/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-46xx/CVE-2015-4666.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4666_2.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-4666-2539.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4666_49.yaml","https://github.com/dragonkeep/GoAttack/blob/2aaf40db0a28fb52ea4cd0b95a7b155c877767a7/GoAttack-Api/service/lib/templates/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4666.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/08/Reports/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0508","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4495","title":"Mozilla Firefox PDF Viewer 同源策略绕过信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox PDF查看器（pdf.js）存在同源策略绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的JavaScript代码结合原生setter，绕过同源策略限制，读取任意本地文件或提升权限。该漏洞影响Firefox 39.0.3之前版本、Firefox ESR 38.1.1之前版本及Firefox OS 2.2之前版本，CVSS评分8.8（高危）。攻击者诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发（需用户交互），2015年8月已在野利用，Mozilla已于2015年8月发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4495"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-08-08T00:59:04.597","updated":"2026-06-17T00:27:24.177","remediation":"建议将 Firefox 升级至 39.0.3 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 38.1.1。如暂无法升级，可在 about:config 中设置 pdfjs.disabled 为 true 以禁用内置 PDF 查看器，或通过 about:preferences#applications 将 PDF 文件关联到外部程序打开，从而阻断攻击向量。事后应检查 .ssh/、.bash_history、FTP 客户端配置文件是否曾被异常访问，并更改相关密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-08/msg00009.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-08/msg00010.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-08/msg00014.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-08/msg00015.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-08/msg00021.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-09/msg00016.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1581.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2015/mfsa2015-78.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/bulletinapr2016-2952098.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/76249","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033216","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2707-1","https://blog.mozilla.org/security/2015/08/06/firefox-exploit-found-in-the-wild/","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1178058","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1179262","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201512-10","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37772/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-4495","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37772","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-4495.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/264ef61746a7918b62cf1abbd77516d3c9b09ba8/2015/CVE-2015-4495.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/62d3575ad7f5edb0085d16f3737a19e0c0ea724b/2015/CVE-2015-4495/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4495","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-re